Z||000003||Formula88||11-22-2001||03:16 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Mike Murphy:<BR><B>I think I would tend to blame a lot of people beside myself when I had put my heart and sole into it as he did.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah, I'd like to put my <B>sole</B> somewhere.  But I'll wager Hulki put his heart and <B>soul</B> into the Fiero.||||reg||13
Z||000004||fiero56||11-22-2001||05:22 AM||||I know what your intentions are, I'm not going to get sucked in any more than I have to. The contract was 30K Fiero cars a year. <P>There were so many reasons to dump the Fiero. The main reason WAS they weren't selling enough Fieros to justify building it(do you think they would have canned the car if they were selling 75K a year, highly unlikely)? WHY they weren't selling enough, was typical GM. They didn't handle anything correctly from the first month the cars were available to the public.||||reg||1
